<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · 从入口穿到出口：熬过苦难、促成交易、彻底完成与落空 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Entering and Exiting the Other Side — EPE Ch.2 §6.2 & Ch.9 §6.2</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>39 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §6.2 & Ch.9 §6.2)：</b>THROUGH 的基本图式是<b>「从三维空间的一端进入，穿过内部介质，从另一端走出来（Into, then out the other end）」</b>。通过“经验实体化（Reification）”，苦难、疾病、离婚或法案审批被视为一条漫长的隧道：成功走出来即为熬过难关或顺利通过（<i>go/get/pull/sail/see/carry through</i>）；从地板漏洞掉下去没走通即为计划泡汤（<i>fall through</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>1/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>go or live through</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>see</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>We had many trials to <b>go</b> <b>through</b>.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He saw action in Viet Nam.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [complete] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>finish a task completely</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>complete, finish</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>I finally got through this homework assignment.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [reach] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>succeed in reaching a real or abstract destination after overcoming problems</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>reach, attain</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We finally got through the bureaucracy and could talk to the Minister.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>3/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>spend or pass, as with boredom or in a pleasant manner; of time</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>spend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>get</b> it <b>through</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>4/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>become clear or enter one's consciousness or emotions</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>click, dawn</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>It dawned on him that she had betrayed him.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She was penetrated with sorrow.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [appear] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>penetrate</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>appear</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The sun broke through the clouds.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The rescue team broke through the wall in the mine shaft.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: transit)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make a passage or journey from one place to another</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>transit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The tourists moved through the town and bought up all the souvenirs;.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Some travelers <b>pass</b> <b>through</b> the desert.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>2/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [apply] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>apply thoroughly; think through</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>apply</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We worked through an example.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: cause)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cause to move through</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cause</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Pass</b> a chemical <b>through</b> a solution.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>see <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [complete] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>remain with until completion</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>complete, finish</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>I must <b>see</b> the job <b>through</b>.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>see <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [perceive] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>perceive the true nature of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>perceive, comprehend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We could <b>see</b> <b>through</b> her apparent calm.</div></div></div></td></tr>
