<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 物理穿透、目光看穿伪装、从头翻检到尾与电话接通 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Penetration, Insight & Thorough Search — EPE Ch.1 §17 & Ch.9 §6.1</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>8 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.1 §17 & Ch.9 §6.1)：</b>① <b>物理或目光穿透</b>：冲破屏障（<i>break/cut through</i>）或视线直接穿透谎言看清本质（<i>see through sb/a trick</i>）；② <b>完结体彻底遍历</b>：在整叠文件或整本书的内部空间从头翻找审阅到尾（<i>look/read/go/sift/comb through</i>，<i>think it through</i>）；信号穿过线路抵达对方即为接通（<i>put/get through</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [apply] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>apply thoroughly; think through</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>apply</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We <b>worked</b> <b>through</b> an example.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [apply] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>apply thoroughly; think through</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>apply</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We worked through an example.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [consume] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>use up (resources or materials)</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>consume, eat</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>This car consumes a lot of gas.</div></div>
